!
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.
.WAVE F
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.EXACC
*SCF
.CLOSED SHELL
4
.OPEN SHELL
1
1 / 2
.EVCCNV
1.0E-9
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -100.0 0.5 0.00001
**EXACC
.OCCUPIED
1..3
.VIRTUAL
4..10
.OCC_BETA
1..2
.VIR_BETA
3..10
.EXATENSOR
.PRINT
3
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACT
*END OF
